50:[$0909F6]Barbarian[$ffffff]: YOU! You should have known better coming here!
51:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: Destillion... I come in peace... and in the name of Iris.
52:[$0909F6]Destillion[$ffffff]: Where is she? Speak quickly!
53:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: Unfortunately... I bring sad and terrible news.
54:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: Iris... is dead...
55:[$0909F6]Destillion[$ffffff]: It's your fault! You brought them to us! They took her away with you!
56:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: Give it a break, Chieftain. Iris was murdered by the tyrant who currently terrorizes Artidram. You have a chance to make your revenge.
57:[$0909F6]Destillion[$ffffff]: We refuse to listen to anyone! Only Iris was our guide. Thanks to her, our house grew strong.
58:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: So this is the great Tribe of Destillion? Over ten years ago, you charged Artidram to overthrow the king of Valtaria, and now you're afraid to go into battle?
59:[$0909F6]Destillion[$ffffff]: You'd better watch your words...
60:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: The tribeof Destillion spread fear. They tell terrible stories about him before bed! Where is your thirst for revenge?!
61:[$0909F6]Barbarian[$ffffff]: Iris sensed the coming threats and supported us with her tactics... Now we are weakened.
62:[$0909F6]Destillion[$ffffff]: Be silent!... The Tribe of Destillion shows no weakness. But the King of the West is right. It wasn't Iris who contributed to the legends. It was our courage and bloodlust. The ability to look death in the eye!! We will fight, but only in revenge for Iris.
63:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: Then let's move as quickly as possible. There's no time to waste.